from (values
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 1, 'The next time you reach for your phone to look something up out of worry, set it face down and wait five minutes before deciding whether you still need to.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 2, 'Say the words "I don''t know yet" out loud once today, about anything at all, and notice that nothing bad happens.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 3, 'Draw a line down a sheet of paper. On the left, list what you can control about one worry; on the right, what you can''t.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 4, 'Pick one open question in your life and plan only the very next step, then put the rest of the path out of sight.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 5, 'Take a different route on one ordinary trip today and pay attention to what you see along the way.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 6, 'When a text arrives that is not urgent, let it sit for thirty minutes before you reply.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 7, 'Write down one time in the past when you did not know how something would turn out, and how it actually went.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 8, 'Think of one thing you are waiting on and write two sentences: one where it goes well, one where it doesn''t. Add "both could be true."'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 9, 'Leave one half hour of your afternoon with nothing scheduled in it, and see what you choose to do when it arrives.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 10, 'Check tomorrow''s forecast once, then close it and decide you will dress for whatever shows up.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 11, 'Choose a lunch you have never ordered before and eat it without reading any reviews first.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 12, 'Make one small choice today in under a minute, such as what to cook or which shirt to wear, and stick with it.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 13, 'Before a worry spirals, ask yourself: "Is this something I can act on today?" If not, jot it down and set it aside.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 14, 'Notice one moment today when you felt curious instead of worried, and write down what you were curious about.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 15, 'Name one value that matters to you, like kindness or honesty, and let it decide one small choice you make today.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 16, 'Step outside and find one sign that the season is shifting, whether a leaf, a light, or a smell in the air.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 17, 'When you feel the pull to ask someone for reassurance, pause, take three slow breaths, and see if the urge softens on its own.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 18, 'Make a "good enough" plan for one thing this week, then add a single backup in case it changes.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 19, 'Write one sentence beginning "I can live with not knowing whether..." and finish it honestly.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 20, 'Sit with an unanswered question for two minutes without trying to solve it. Just let it be there.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 21, 'Recall a time when something you dreaded turned out to be a gift in disguise, and tell someone that story.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 22, 'Cook a simple recipe you have never tried, and resist checking whether you are doing it right more than once.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 23, 'Pick one thing you have been researching over and over and give yourself permission to stop for today.'),
  ('making-peace-with-uncertainty', 24, 'Watch the clouds for three minutes and notice that their shape keeps changing whether you watch or not.'),
